  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Consolidated inventory and currency review</h2><p>Prepare elimination amounts and identify the currency-accounting approach.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f1\">Intercompany profit on the sale</label><input id=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f2\">Unrealized profit in ending inventory</label><input id=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f3\">Reciprocal receivable amount eliminated</label><input id=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f4\">General location of the translation adjustment</label><select id=\"bar-m2-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Other comprehensive income\">Other comprehensive income</option><option value=\"Sales revenue\">Sales revenue</option><option value=\"Operating cash receipts\">Operating cash receipts</option><option value=\"Taxable wages\">Taxable wages</option></select></div></section>",
