  "explanation": "<h3>Intercompany profit on the sale</h3><p>$140,000 − $100,000 = $40,000.</p><h3>Unrealized profit in ending inventory</h3><p>30% × $40,000 = $12,000.</p><h3>Reciprocal receivable amount eliminated</h3><p>Eliminate the $50,000 intercompany receivable and matching payable.</p><h3>General location of the translation adjustment</h3><p>The stated foreign-functional-currency translation generally creates an OCI adjustment.</p>"
